    <string id="pf_nes_help"><text>WASD / arrows: navigate\nSpace: confirm</text></string>
    <string id="pf_nes_battle_help"><text>WASD / arrows: move\nSpace: fire (hold)</text></string>
    <string id="pf_nes_two_player_help"><text>P1: WASD + Space\nP2: arrows + Enter\nHold fire to repeat\nAutofire: player 1</text></string>
    <string id="pf_nes_editor_done"><text>Done</text></string>
    <string id="pf_nes_editor_help"><text>WASD / arrows: cursor\nSpace: cycle/place block</text></string>
    <string id="pf_nes_rules_goal_heading"><text>Objective</text></string>
    <string id="pf_nes_rules_goal_body"><text>Defend headquarters, destroy tanks and collect bonuses.</text></string>
    <string id="pf_nes_rules_controls_heading"><text>Menus and controls</text></string>
    <string id="pf_nes_rules_controls_body"><text>Menus: WASD / arrows select an option; Space confirms.\nSolo: WASD / arrows move; Space fires.\nTwo players: P1 uses WASD + Space; P2 uses arrows + Enter.\nHold fire to repeat; Autofire works for player 1.\nConstruction: movement controls the cursor; Space changes blocks; Done exits.</text></string>
    <string id="pf_nes_rules_progress_heading"><text>Progress</text></string>
    <string id="pf_nes_rules_progress_body"><text>Completed stages are green; the rest are gray.\nOnly new victories count; history is kept between launches.</text></string>
    <string id="pf_nes_rules_saving_heading"><text>Saving and exit</text></string>
    <string id="pf_nes_rules_saving_body"><text>Esc returns to the games list; re-enter to resume. F6 saves.\nAutosave: every ~20 seconds and on PDA close. F9 does not rewind the battle.\nMain menu / F2 confirms a battle reset; victories are kept.</text></string>
    <string id="pf_nes_rules_sound_heading"><text>Volume</text></string>
    <string id="pf_nes_rules_sound_body"><text>-/+ below Sound: 0-100%, steps of 10%, default 50%.\nThis setting is saved separately.</text></string>
